WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.549
Disrobing in front of the camera no longer
carries quite the same stigma it used to,

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:06.580
but that doesn't mean every actor is willing
to do it.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.740
Here are some stars who aren't willing to
appear naked onscreen and the reasons why.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.300
Mila Kunis landed the role of Jackie on That
'70s Show when she was only fourteen years

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:15.800
old.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:20.320
She's had steady roles ever since, including
2010's Black Swan, which landed her a Golden

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.480
Globe nomination for Best Supporting Actress.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.080
Kunis played a ballerina in that film and
she's revealed that her physical appearance

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.700
in it brought about a good deal of media scrutiny.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.720
When she starred in Friends with Benefits
the following year, her body once again became

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.860
a subject of interest.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.040
Kunis had to do a love scene with her co-star
Justin Timberlake.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.100
Timberlake is a friend of hers, so, as she
told Allure, the scene wound up being more

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.280
"funny and mechanical" than titillating.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.460
"I keep my socks on.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.460
Intimacy issues."

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:48.140
"Great, 'cause feet gross me out.

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:48.980
Daddy issues."

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:49.480
"Great."

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.500
But the issue of nudity still happened to
come up.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.020
She did show some "side boob" but not her
rear end.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:54.760
As she put it,

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.170
"You get one or the other.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:56.800
You don't need both."

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:02.859
In 2007, Mandy Moore was coming off a string
of acting roles that really cemented her status

00:01:02.859 --> 00:01:04.470
as a leading lady in Hollywood.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:10.140
Between 2006 and 2007 alone, she had ten credits
to her name, but, according to an interview

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.530
with USA Today at the time, that number could've
been higher, if only she'd agreed to appear

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.020
nude.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:15.820
As she explained,

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:19.780
"It would be completely uncomfortable to walk
down the street and know that the person passing

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.500
by had seen me without my clothes on.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:26.020
I've turned down several roles where the producers
or directors or writers wouldn't budge on

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:26.560
that point."

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.860
That no-nudity clause also extends to men's
magazines.

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.700
While Moore doesn't consider herself a prude,
taking off her clothing is just something

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:34.810
she's never wanted to do.

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:36.009
As she told USA Today,

00:01:36.009 --> 00:01:39.170
"I'm not saying that it's wrong for someone
else to do them, but I think there's a way

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:41.800
to be feminine and sexy without posing half-naked."

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:47.100
When Ricky Gervais and Jennifer Garner were
doing press for their 2009 film The Invention

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:52.090
of Lying, an MTV News reporter made the mistake
of comparing Gervais' shirtless body to that

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.640
of one of Garner's previous co-stars, Matthew
McConaughey.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:58.530
Gervais took the comment in stride, but it
did raise the question as to whether or not

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:00.460
he'd be willing to take it all off for a future
role.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:03.460
Gervais declared that there was "no chance"
of him doing nudity.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:06.740
When Garner chimed in to say that she wouldn't
bare all either, he continued,

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:08.100
"Okay, well then it's equal.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.940
It's joint equal at 'No way!'

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.200
Absolutely no way!"

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:15.120
When pushed, however, Gervais did quietly
hint at the prospect of faking a future nude

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:17.620
scene, so long as he, quote, "had a stunt
one."

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:23.860
Sarah Jessica Parker has a career spanning
four decades, and over that time, she's famously

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.340
refused to appear nude for any one of her
projects.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.560
In 2018, she spoke with People Magazine about
her early experiences as an actress, recalling

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.900
that there was "so much pressure" for her
to take her clothes off.

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.660
She was lucky enough to have her agent in
her corner when the subject of nudity came

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.520
up on set.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.140
She explained,

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.260
"My agent sent a car and a plane ticket [to
the film set] and he said, 'If anybody makes

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:45.740
you do anything that you're not comfortable
doing, you don't.'

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:49.791
Given what's happening now and the stories
told from that particular period, I know how

00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:53.300
lucky I am that there was someone, in this
case, a man, who stepped in."

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:58.069
Parker also asserted that her opinion on appearing
nude only extends as far as herself, as she

00:02:58.069 --> 00:02:58.680
also said,

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:01.380
"It's not a value thing, or like I'm judging
anyone else.

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:02.390
I just never dug it."

00:03:04.209 --> 00:03:08.239
When it came time to start filming the finale
to the Fifty Shades trilogy, Fifty Shades

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:12.659
Freed, there was a lot of talk regarding whether
or not audiences would see all of actor Jamie

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:13.160
Dornan.

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:18.200
Co-star Dakota Johnson joked in 2016 about
starting a campaign for him to disrobe on

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.860
an episode of Watch What Happens Live...

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.800
"Everybody wants to see the D."

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.180
"Yeah, show us the D!"

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:28.239
...and there were rumors that Dornan had been
offered $1.5 million to bare it all for the

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.100
final film.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:30.540
He didn't, exactly.

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:34.940
He wore what's called a modesty pouch instead,
and he told Elle that those rumors were just

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:35.440
that.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:35.940
He joked:

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:38.660
"It was $30 million to show one testicle.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.560
No, that whole thing with offering more money
to go nude?

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.650
That didn't happen."

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:45.090
For Dornan, the movie wouldn't have been improved
by it.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:45.780
He told Elle:

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:49.460
"I just thought, we don't need to be flashing
the rest if it's not essential to the story.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:52.260
We're not making porn as much as people think
we are."

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:57.130
These days, Jessica Alba might be better known
for her natural baby and beauty company, The

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.909
Honest Company, than for her acting career,
which started when she was just a kid with

00:04:00.909 --> 00:04:02.640
1994's Camp Nowhere.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:07.000
Since then, she's starred in countless films
and has often played the attractive love interest.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:11.180
For a number of those roles, her wardrobe
has been rather limited, but she's never gone

00:04:11.189 --> 00:04:14.019
fully nude, and the reason for that has to
do with her family.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.780
As she told Glamour in 2014,

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.880
"I don't want my grandparents to see my boobs.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:18.760
That's it.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.300
It would be weird at Christmas."

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.760
Alba also touched on the possibility of doing
nudity for a particular role or storyline

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:29.020
that could be bettered by it, while also taking
a lighthearted jab at her own filmography.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:29.680
As she put it,

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.060
"I mean, really, if you look at the movies
I have done, getting naked would never 'elevate'

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:34.800
the picture."

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:39.240
Christina Hendricks worked as a model for
years during her twenties before she gained

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:43.920
mainstream fame as the strong-willed Joan
Holloway on AMC's Mad Men in 2007.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:48.080
Her character was known for her form-fitting
attire, leading to Hendricks becoming something

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.340
of a modern bombshell.

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:51.220
The actress told BlackBook in 2012,

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.360
"[Joan] was very openly saying, 'I have sex,
and I don't care if you judge me.

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.199
I'm not going to apologize for who I am.'

00:04:57.199 --> 00:05:00.650
Those qualities resonated with people, and
have given me confidence."

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:05.410
But for as much sex appeal as Hendricks oozes
on TV and in movies, you won't be seeing her

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:09.320
completely nude on screen anytime soon, and
the reason why might surprise you.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:13.060
While she's comfortable in the privacy of
her own bedroom, she isn't so much that way

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:13.880
outside of it.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.130
As she explained to BlackBook,

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.160
"I'm a very comfortable naked person.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:21.000
Not in front of other people, but at home
and in front of my husband, I feel good not

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:21.780
wearing clothes."

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:27.380
Julia Roberts rose to fame when she played
a worker with a heart of gold in 1990's Pretty

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:27.880
Woman.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:32.240
While playing a literal worker might be a
call for nudity if ever there was one, Roberts

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:34.540
never once appeared without her clothes in
the film.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:38.900
She's also remained firm throughout her entire
career about her personal no-nudity stance.

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:42.880
According to her, nudity isn't really a part
of acting, at least not for her.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.039
She told OK!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.180
Magazine in 2007,

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.940
"I wouldn't do nudity in a film.

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.880
To act with my clothes on is a performance.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.000
To act with my clothes off is a documentary."

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:55.940
In 2009, Roberts starred in the thriller Duplicity,
whose original script called for a raunchy

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.500
sex scene, but she insisted that it be toned
down.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.600
By that point in her life, she was married
with kids, a life change that seemed to further

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.650
cement her position.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.240
At the film's premiere, she said,

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.540
"You know it's not really what I do, so if
you are going to ask me to do it, you have

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.020
to expect it to be toned down.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.520
You know, as a mom of three, I feel like that."

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.660
"They're called boobs, Ed."

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:20.340
Between 2010 and 2017, Ashley Benson starred
on the teen soap drama Pretty Little Liars.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:25.180
In 2012, she shed her good girl image by appearing
in the controversial indie Spring Breakers.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:28.870
The film features a group of college girls
who spend most of the running time wearing

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:33.110
little more than bikinis, but for Benson,
that's as far as it was ever going to go.

00:06:33.110 --> 00:06:37.440
In a 2014 interview with Cosmopolitan, the
actress said that she isn't afraid to walk

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.980
away when she's pushed to do something she
doesn't want to.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:40.600
As she explained,

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.260
"I make it clear that I have a line.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:46.060
Everyone tries to push you, and it's easy
to get talked into doing those things.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:49.740
I'll just walk off-set: 'If that's the way
it's going to be, then you can do it without

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:50.240
me.'"

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:54.180
For Benson, nudity in a film should never
be done gratuitously, and she also believes

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:58.630
that girls look better in lingerie or a tee
shirt while leaving the rest up to the imagination.

00:06:59.880 --> 00:07:03.500
Samuel L. Jackson has been a working actor
in Hollywood since 1973.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:05.840
He has nearly 200 credits to his name.

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:08.360
And he has never once appeared fully nude
on camera.

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:13.120
When he stopped by The Howard Stern Show in
2016, he was asked about going full monty.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.139
He recalled doing two nude scenes but also
noted that he had never gone full-frontal.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:21.260
It turns out that the reason for Jackson's
modesty has to do with a certain lack of self-confidence.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:23.060
"I don't know if it's...yeah."

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:23.560
"Right."

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.160
"Yeah."

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:24.800
"Smart.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.940
I would do the same thing."

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:28.100
"I don't know if it's formidable enough to,
you know."

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:32.220
Jackson's unwillingness to do nudity might
also have something to do with wanting to

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:35.760
avoid the negative audience reaction that
actors who have bared all have had to deal

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:36.260
with.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.300
"That's what you don't want."

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:42.300
Over the course of its six-season run, the
HBO sitcom Girls featured plenty of nudity

00:07:42.300 --> 00:07:42.920
from its stars.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:47.340
But Allison Williams, who played Marnie Michaels,
refused to bare all even before the series

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.180
began shooting.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:52.800
In a 2017 interview on Popcorn with Peter
Travers, Williams said there was only so much

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:54.500
she was willing to give to her character.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.640
"I wanted to give Marnie almost all of myself.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:01.660
But I...there were things that felt like they
should be mine."

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:05.800
Williams' refusal to sign the network's nudity
waiver was met with some surprise.

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:09.500
She said that her agents just figured she
would "get swept up in the vibe of the show"

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.680
and change her mind eventually, but she never
did.

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:15.470
She also expressed that she didn't want to
burden her potential future children with

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:16.820
another way to be made fun of.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.660
Because she stuck to her guns, now those future
kids won't have to worry about classmates

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:23.260
showing up to school with Google images of
their naked mom.

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.560
Megan Fox has never been shy when it comes
to showing her body on camera.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.620
In her breakout role in 2007's Transformers,
she generally wore as little clothing as possible

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:35.300
without quite appearing nude, and that's the
way she prefers it.

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:39.520
She told the Mirror in 2016 that she didn't
want her sons to ever have to see her without

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.520
clothes on, stating,

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.460
"There are just certain things boys should
never see their mothers do."

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:47.940
Fox's no-nudity clause is so firm, in fact,
that she's admitted to walking away from roles

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:48.620
because of it.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.120
She revealed,

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:53.340
"There are some good projects I've read that
are with talented people, talented directors,

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:56.870
but the things the women are required to do
in the movie are things I can't have my sons

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:58.060
ever know or see."

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:02.220
Fox added that she once turned down an HBO
project because of its graphic sex scenes.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:08.620
During the late '90s and early 2000s, Sarah
Michelle Gellar was the epitome of female

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.640
badassery, playing the title role on Buffy
the Vampire Slayer.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:16.760
In 1999's Cruel Intentions, she did a 180
by taking on the role of the manipulative

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.420
Kathryn, who played men like it was her actual
job.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:23.680
While her character lived and breathed seduction,
she did it all without ever actually removing

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.380
her clothing.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:28.460
It turns out that Gellar won't even go topless,
regardless of how big the paychecks would

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:28.960
be.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:33.460
In 2005, the New York Post reported that she
had been offered some high-paying roles but

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.540
turned them down because she would've had
to take her top off.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:37.360
According to a rep for the actress,

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:39.380
"Sarah doesn't do nudity, period.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.680
It has never been her thing."

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.600
"You think maybe you could get me some clothing?"

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.060
"Yes I can.

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.280
Just don't go anywhere."

